As others have suggested, you probably need to hook a serial terminal up to
the COM1 port (the one on the daughtercard, not the main CPU board) at
9600/N/8/1 and do SET CONSOLE GRAPHICS.

Note that 2.4 and 2.6 kernels at least through 2.6.6 will panic when trying
to boot on this system (known as the Takara). I've submitted a patch, but it
hasn't made it into the kernel yet. I'll dig it up and post it here.


